# =============================================================================
# 20-plasma.list.chroot - KDE Plasma 6 core (required)
# =============================================================================
# What: the Plasma desktop and workspace with both sessions (Wayland is the
#       default, X11 stays available), SDDM, and the system services the
#       desktop needs (networking and audio applets, power management,
#       display configuration, settings, portals, disks and power info).
# Why:  spec section 1 (Desktop row). Debian's kde-plasma-desktop
#       metapackage hard-depends on kde-baseapps (Dolphin and others), so it
#       is only recommended (25-desktop-extras). Otherwise removing Dolphin
#       would remove nimbusos-desktop. The core it depends on is listed here
#       by name (docs/PLAN.md NOTE-48).
# Format rules: see 10-base.list.chroot.
# =============================================================================

plasma-desktop
plasma-workspace
kwin-wayland
kwin-x11
xwayland
sddm
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
powerdevil
kscreen
systemsettings
xdg-desktop-portal-kde
udisks2
upower
